obial mats  stop the growth of any bacteria and ensures that any excess splashes are absorbed completely and dried quickly without leaving a strong odor in your restroom.These toilet mats also incorporate polypropylene fibers in their design, allowing them to air dry quickly.<\/p>","button_label":"buy restroom mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/urinal-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"503819cc-8a8b-4a33-82c4-77486f156fa1":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/disinfectant_mat_2_720x_25eaf04f-32f1-4039-8746-b711ddc9848f.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Clean room mats","text":"<p>Keep certain areas and rooms clean from contaminants with our variety of clean room mats for various applications.<\/p>","button_label":"buy clean room mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/clean-room-mats","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"309f8b57-be9b-47dc-af6f-2e2eeacdb7b1":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486679715969__309f8b57-be9b-47dc-af6f-2e2eeacdb7b1-1678250364b3e3723b-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_3354_3f231cce-477b-4521-a655-e5e05e238fbd.png","image_width":420,"title":"matting accessories","text":"<p>Find a variety of matting accessories to finish off your project.<br\/>From wire protectors to anti-slip underlays, we have it all.<\/p>","button_label":"view matting accessories","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/matting-accessories"}},"template--14486679715969__309f8b57-be9b-47dc-af6f-2e2eeacdb7b1-1678250364b3e3723b-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/clear-gripper-rubber-mat_7_720x_af96f89a-5ad9-4aac-bd88-50b1aa60f1fc.png","image_width":530,"title":"vinyl carpet protectors","text":"<p>The perfect way to cover up and protect flooring during high traffic times such as h